'' --diagnostics-file named by a '#cmdline' in the source is REFUSED (TKO0178): a source may
'' not choose a file the compiler writes besides its program. The refusal is recorded in the
'' command line's own file, and the source's is never made.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --diagnostics-file build/.diagfile-outer.tsv --parse-only tests/driver/src/diagfile-directive.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 2
'' EXPECT-FILE-HAS: build/.diagfile-outer.tsv :: error\tTKO0178\t
'' EXPECT-NO-FILE: build/.diagfile-refused.tsv
